{
  "A text field with a list that follows what is typed. The items come from memory or from a data source of the data layer, searched on the server. `Autocomplete` is the free-text kind: the value is the text.": "",
  "With `dataSource` the search goes to the data source (its `searchFields`), after `searchDelay`. In `'blocks'` mode only the rows in view load; a value on no loaded page is found by key, so the field shows its text at once. This one holds 10,000 products and answers after 300 ms.": "",
  "Custom values and Autocomplete": "",
  "Take the highlighted item (or the text, see `acceptCustomValue`) and close.": "",
  "An item whose text is the text is taken; otherwise the custom value or the chosen item again.": "",
  "Close the list; closed, undo the typing; then, with `clearButton`, empty it.": "",
  "The APG combobox with list autocomplete: the input is `role=\"combobox\"`, `aria-autocomplete=\"list\"`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`.": "",
  "Rows not loaded yet are options with `aria-busy`, reading \"Loading…\" from `uiLocale`.": "",
  "The value of the chosen item; `x-model` binds it.": "",
  "As for DropDown; groups for items in memory.": "",
  "How items in memory match.": "",
  "Characters to type before the list opens.": "",
  "Text that matches no item becomes the value; otherwise the field goes back to the chosen item.": "",
  "The first match is highlighted, so Enter takes it.": "",
  "The arrow that opens every item; the button that empties it.": "",
  "As for DropDown.": "",
  "The item of the value, when known.": "",
  "The list and the value.": "",
  "Your items may be plain or reactive; the box reads them as they are. After changing them in place, call `refresh()`. The open list and the text of the value follow. Autocomplete has it too.": "",
  "The items part is shared: `DataItems` feeds any list control from an array or a data source.": ""
}
